---
title: Staff - Update My Profile Flow (PATCH /staff/me)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Staff Client
    participant Ctrl as StaffController
    participant Guard as AuthGuard
    participant Service as StaffService
    participant StaffModel as StaffInfoModel (TypeORM Repository)
    participant DB as Database (SQL Server)

    note right of Client: PATCH /staff/me (with Bearer Token)
    Client->>Ctrl: UpdateMyProfileDto (fullName?, phone?, address?, birthDate?)
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>Guard: canActivate(context)
    Guard->>Guard: Verify JWT & attach user (sub = accountId) to request
    alt JWT invalid / expired
        Guard-->>Client: Throw UnauthorizedException
    else JWT valid
        Guard-->>Ctrl: return true
    end

    Ctrl->>Service: updateMyProfile(req.user.sub, dto)
    activate Service
    Service->>StaffModel: findOne({ where: { accountId } })
    StaffModel->>DB: SELECT * FROM StaffInfo WHERE AccountId = ?
    DB-->>StaffModel: row / null
    StaffModel-->>Service: StaffInfo Entity / null
    opt Staff not found
        Service-->>Client: Throw NotFoundException
    end

    Note over Service: Apply partial field updates from dto

    Service->>StaffModel: save(staffInfo)
    StaffModel->>DB: UPDATE StaffInfo SET FullName=?, Phone=?, Address=?, BirthDate=? WHERE AccountId = ?
    DB-->>StaffModel: updated row
    StaffModel-->>Service: Updated StaffInfo Entity
    Service-->>Ctrl: Updated StaffInfo Entity
    deactivate Service

    Ctrl-->>Client: HTTP 200 - { staff: StaffInfo }
    deactivate Ctrl
